\title{mlr3pseudovalue: Pseudo-Value Reduction Pipeline Operators for 'mlr3proba'}
\description{
Extends the 'mlr3proba' survival ecosystem with the pseudo-value reduction: survival times are replaced by pseudo-observations, the jackknife contributions of a non-parametric estimator of the survival probability or of the restricted mean survival time at one or more fixed time points. Pipeline operators turn a survival task into a regression task on these pseudo-values and map the regression predictions back to a survival prediction, so that any regression learner can be used for time-to-event data.
}
